1️⃣ Keep your word, even when it’s difficult or inconvenient.
(people trust those whose actions always match their promises)

2️⃣ Stay calm when someone tries to disrespect or provoke you.
(the person who controls their emotions usually earns the most respect)

3️⃣ Look people in the eyes and speak with confidence.
(strong eye contact makes you appear calm, secure, and trustworthy)

4️⃣ Use an app like @eidos.app that gives you daily tasks on how to improve your confidence and charisma

5️⃣ Stop trying to make everyone like you.
(respect comes from authenticity, not from constantly seeking approval)

6️⃣ Set clear boundaries and enforce them without feeling guilty.
(the way you let others treat you teaches them how to respect you)

7️⃣ Take responsibility for your mistakes instead of making excuses.
(owning your failures is one of the fastest ways to earn respect)

8️⃣ Walk away from people who repeatedly disrespect your values.
(not every argument deserves your time, energy, or attention)

9️⃣ Treat everyone with respect, even if they can’t do anything for you.
(the strongest people don’t need to put others down to feel important)

🔟 Respect yourself before expecting respect from anyone else.
(the way you carry yourself teaches people exactly how to treat you)
